<h3><u>Abbas teri behno ko</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haye shaam, haye shaam..(2)<br />
Haye abbas, haye abbas..(3)<br />
Abbas teri behno ko, bazaar mein laaya jatah hai..(2)</p>

<p>1. Suraj ne khule sar jisko, ghar mein bhi kabhi na dekha<br />
afsos wahi shehzadi, balwe mein gai wawaila<br />
zainab ki yaha aamad par, darbaar sajaya jaata hai</p>

<p>2. Kis shaan se teri zainab, mehmil me chali thi ghar se<br />
aur aaj safar par nikli, to raah mein patthar barse<br />
be parda nabi zaadi ko, galiyo&#39;n me phiraya jaata hai</p>

<p>3. Kya tujhse kahu ae ghazi, dekhe hai yaha ghum kaise<br />
raaho mein sakina teri, paani ke liye gar roye<br />
bache ko dikha kar paani, reti pe bahaya jaata hai</p>

<p>4. Be dard hai be ghairat hai, ye shaam ke rehne waale<br />
aankho&#39;n pe pade hai parde, aur inki zaba&#39;n par taale<br />
ye chup hai nabi zadi ko, balwe me bulaya jaata hai</p>

<p>5. Ek lamha nahi hai aisa, eeza na koi pohchaye<br />
thak kar wo kahi gar baithe, sajjad ko neend aa jaye<br />
haye haye zanjeer hilakar, qaidi ko jagaya jaata hai</p>

<p>6. Dohraya gaya maazi ko, hai zulm wohi aur ghum bhi<br />
ummat bhi wohi, chehre bhi, darbaar wohi aur hum bhi<br />
kal amma jaha&#39;n aayi thi, ab mujhko bulaya jaata hai</p>

<p>7. Raaho mein kisi manzil par, deta jo hume koi chadar<br />
le jaate hai phir wo chadar, hakim ke sipahi aakar<br />
ek ghum me teri zainab ko, kai baar rulaya jaata hai</p>

<p>28. Barsaat kabhi durro ki, hoti hai kahi sangbaari<br />
ae bhai bata kyu na ho,jeene se mujhe bezaari<br />
sadaat ko in raaho mein, har gaam sataya jaata hai</p>

<p>9. Ye farsh e aza ye matam, zainab ka qarz hai humpar<br />
duniya se kahe fir kyu na, farhan aur mazhar rokar<br />
jo aale nabi par guzri, nauho mein sunaya jaata hai</p>

<p>Haye shaam, haye shaam..(2)</p>
</p>
